# Identity and records (never-delete)

Product law: Bible §12, §13.5, §17; Law 7. Audit V6 is the failure this rule exists to prevent.

## Non-negotiables

- **Human owns:** Church rank, Council status, honorifics / major accolades, membership history, aggregate identity
- **Character owns:** name, class, level, professions, **Gora record**, gameplay history
- **Profile aggregates** those character stories onto the human (MVP stays simple, §12.5)
- **No self-service linking.** Rite of Recognition only: Pope or Council confirms with the **logged-in** character. Bible shape: ~thirty seconds; the alt kneels; is acknowledged; is formally bound. Not a silent admin bind. Council may confirm; the store write remains the Pope's (Law 5). Do not invent widgets.
- **History is never deleted.** Tombstones / inactive flags only. No prune, no departed-member sweep, no record expiry
- **Account-level SavedVariables:** `ChurchOfBeefDB` is per account (`## SavedVariables:`), not per character (Audit V6; handoff Phase 2). Per-character SV / "alts start fresh" is **not law**
- Identity is more than a name string. `COB.Names.Key` / `Display` normalize a **spelling**. They are **not** the human and **not** durable character identity (§12.4 name reuse). Do not invent a replacement key (schema is out of scope).
- **Church rank lives on the human, never on the character row.** Do not default an unlinked alt to Fresh Beef as if rank were per-character. Do not invent unlinked-character rank display.
- Shared accounts / two humans: **no machinery.** The Pope resolves socially
- Sacred Archive: one-action export/import (file/string), restore, integrity. Weekly reminder in **cold** state only (never mid-ceremony). Council cold mirror is read-only disaster recovery — **not a second writer**
- Privacy: record **events**, not behavior; **no activity leaderboards**; members see their own record; Curtain opt-out covers *displayed* witnessed activity except rank / Knighting / sanctioned Gora results
- Pope's Notebook is private (§18.3 / §17) — never public, never auto-published

## Banned (do not rebuild)

| Pattern | Why |
|---------|-----|
| `SweepDeparted`, 14-day grace, departed purge, record expiry | Law 7 / §12.3 |
| `SavedVariablesPerCharacter` as product law; "alts start fresh" | §12.1; Audit V6 |
| Self-link, same-account auto-link, player-claimed alt without rite | §12.2 |
| Treating a name string (or `Names.Key`) as the human **or** as durable character identity | §12.4 name reuse / impersonation |
| Prune / wipe on leave, character delete, or inactivity | §12.3 — records survive the character |
| Auto-restore rank on return | §12.3 — restoration is a human call |
| Activity hours, combat minutes, contribution scores, activity leaderboards | §4.9 / §17 |
| Second Archive writer; mid-ceremony Archive nag | §13.5 |
| Curtain hiding rank, Knighting, or sanctioned Gora results | §17 |

